                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d93b9b3c-1ae1-34a3-86fa-54987f32f96e",
                        "entry_id": "ccd1dd69-0934-3af9-83c6-43abba8307cc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Person, die sich schlecht benimmt/sich ungesittet verhält"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "56151a3b-3057-44df-a1d9-05b661cc5c1e",
                                "sense_id": "d93b9b3c-1ae1-34a3-86fa-54987f32f96e",
                                "text": "„Jetzt kannst du schreiben, dass ich schlecht erzogen bin“, spottete Nasri zum Schluss seines Rüpel-Auftritts."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "618f4a00-0006-4b4f-9e89-d1744f0a37ea",
                                "sense_id": "d93b9b3c-1ae1-34a3-86fa-54987f32f96e",
                                "text": "„Der Rüpel aber lachte nur darüber.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d01e135f-3618-45d8-aed9-edd744e41aec",
                        "source_entry_id": "ccd1dd69-0934-3af9-83c6-43abba8307cc",
                        "source_sense_id": "d93b9b3c-1ae1-34a3-86fa-54987f32f96e",
                        "source_sense_description": "Person, die sich schlecht benimmt/sich ungesittet verhält",
                        "target_lang_word": "rowdy",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "rowdy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fad447c1-764b-35a0-b218-1e42ee965cb8",
                                        "entry_id": "09b0c222-20eb-3294-a9f1-a78e47b27bed",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Loud and disorderly; riotous; boisterous."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "rowdy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3699251a-7afa-33e1-aef2-94fac1a4a54d",
                                        "entry_id": "73c4aef6-ad88-3330-aab3-137947b09320",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A boisterous person; a brawler."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7b92a542-8d9e-482f-8665-7256ab8976e0",
                                                "sense_id": "3699251a-7afa-33e1-aef2-94fac1a4a54d",
                                                "text": "Carpenter recruited his gang at the saloon, rowdies all. They slept the day, drank well into the evening, and then set off for their pastime."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3ea1ca85-f43c-3869-91bc-c996bde4a05e",
                                        "entry_id": "73c4aef6-ad88-3330-aab3-137947b09320",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "money; ready money."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "slang",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9aed4d22-7236-4499-b616-a90c769259ca",
                                                "sense_id": "3ea1ca85-f43c-3869-91bc-c996bde4a05e",
                                                "text": "I don’t know whether I quite approve of your throwing over Mr. P. for Mr. F., and don’t think Foker’s such a pretty name, and from your account of him he seems a muff, and not a beauty. But he has got the rowdy, which is the thing."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3dc925c9-f1a4-4595-8647-3d302f49c851",
                                                "sense_id": "3ea1ca85-f43c-3869-91bc-c996bde4a05e",
                                                "text": "\"Where's your money?\" Jack exclaimed, hoarsely, in a well-feigned voice.\n\"Ah! where's the rowdy?\" iterated Clayton, in a tone it was impossible to conceal.\n\"I have no money — none — save a few guineas; there — there — in my pocket […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "65bf07ec-13c1-4f8f-bc0f-3db37c356052",
                                                "sense_id": "3ea1ca85-f43c-3869-91bc-c996bde4a05e",
                                                "text": "The blessing of the priest converts flesh into fish; the skil of the resataurateur changes pet pussies into favourite dishes; the learning of the consmetic-chemist metamorphoses age into youth; the wisdom of Solomen Isaacs transmogrifies old garments into now; the tact of the lawyer makes the worse appear the better cause; and the magic spell of the ready—otherwise know as money, cash, tin, stuff, rhino, root-of-all-evil, blunt, wherewithal, 'rowdy, funds, stumpy, pecuniary, dibs, hard, browns, heavy, mopusses, slugs, shiners, lucre, or 'the filthy,' dust, gelt, chips, lumps, chinkers, mint-drops, pewter, brass, horsenails, rocks, brads, spondulix, needful, dough, spoons, buttons, dimes, or the infallible— will convert every article and item in that old sole-leather into \"duty free.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "dfa56d73-93a9-44a6-84d0-f5ec2d52f41f",
                        "source_entry_id": "ccd1dd69-0934-3af9-83c6-43abba8307cc",
                        "source_sense_id": "d93b9b3c-1ae1-34a3-86fa-54987f32f96e",
                        "source_sense_description": "Person, die sich schlecht benimmt/sich ungesittet verhält",
                        "target_lang_word": "malotru",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "malotru",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "80fb4597-af1a-3298-825b-3d9110995235",
                                        "entry_id": "11b11099-1027-3b13-8778-7a5994a8ec26",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Celui qui est mal élevé, grossier."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca19067d-1f90-414a-a05c-0b88698fe0ba",
                                                "sense_id": "80fb4597-af1a-3298-825b-3d9110995235",
                                                "text": "Sur ce, je me vois dans l’obligation de vous prévenir que vous êtes un fier malotru, et que je vais déposer ma plainte chez le commissaire."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "be178b8d-229f-484f-8d94-1e38e09244d3",
                                                "sense_id": "80fb4597-af1a-3298-825b-3d9110995235",
                                                "text": "Beaucoup de gens sont venus à la rescousse, on me disait que j’avais tort de ne pas aller à Guermantes, que je me donnais l’air d’un malotru, d’un vieil ours."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d3434d85-8e01-44a3-ab2c-4e4306c8c509",
                                                "sense_id": "80fb4597-af1a-3298-825b-3d9110995235",
                                                "text": "Un jour, j’expliquais que malotru, au XVIIᵉ siècle, ne signifiait pas mal élevé, mais mal fait, mal bâti, du latin malum astrum, né sous un mauvais astre."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e6b396b-5d6f-4999-87e0-d905367cbc16",
                                                "sense_id": "80fb4597-af1a-3298-825b-3d9110995235",
                                                "text": "Mais réfléchissant, à tout prendre, ma meute me fait bien du tort, certes !... mais elle me protège des malotrus…"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "639953f5-d04a-4686-b1ce-b085ef002678",
                                                "sense_id": "80fb4597-af1a-3298-825b-3d9110995235",
                                                "text": "Les mains de Caronet semblaient s’affairer sous la table. D’abord je fis semblant de ne pas le voir. Je lançais une première citation : Le chevalier de Lorraine est très malotru et très languissant : il aurait l’air d’être empoisonné, si Mme de Brinvilliers eût été son héritière."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "20ae525b-df06-4bfd-a975-3da6a2db7d8c",
                                                "sense_id": "80fb4597-af1a-3298-825b-3d9110995235",
                                                "text": "Soudain, un malotru parut, arracha la bouteille de la bouche de Nicole, en but le quart, puis, d’une façon qu’on voit tout le temps au cinéma, se versa le reste sur la tête."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "440f1040-68b2-4516-a1c6-1ddcd21cef8c",
                                                "sense_id": "80fb4597-af1a-3298-825b-3d9110995235",
                                                "text": "Dans la classe il n’y avait pas d’institutrice, et j’ai moi aussi commencé à chahuter. Mais pas trop. J’ai juste commencé à glisser deux ou trois petits gratterons prélevés dans le stock que j’ai toujours sur moi sur la tête de ce malotru de Traut Meiser."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
